    <!-- About -->
    <string name="about_the_game">Rules &amp; Scoring</string>
    <string name="dsc_the_game">
Guess the card color or suit to win!\n\n
Scoring:\n
• +1 point for correct color (Red / Black)\n
• +5 points for correct suit (♥ ♦ ♣ ♠)\n
• -1 point for incorrect guess\n\n
Difficulty Levels:\n
• Easy: Win at 15–18 points. Loss only if score drops below -3.\n
• Medium: Win at exactly 21 points. Loss if score drops below 0 or above 21.\n
• Hard: Win at exactly 31 points. Loss if score drops below 0 or above 31.\n\n
Have fun!
    </string>

